# The headers of every static answer of the site (plan 11b Task 3).
# scripts/write-headers.ts writes dist/_headers from this file after each build.
# It puts the SHA-256 of each inline script of dist in place of the hash mark of script-src.
# check-csp then holds the written file to the build, so a stale hash fails.
# Rule form and limits: Workers static assets headers page, last updated 2026-09-22, read 2026-10-19.
# The page allows 100 rules and 2,000 characters a line. check-csp fails a longer line.
# 'wasm-unsafe-eval': the docs search runs the WebAssembly module of Pagefind (plan 11b deviation 6).
# style-src counts in this build: style elements {{STYLE_ELEMENTS}}, style attributes {{STYLE_ATTRIBUTES}}.
# The review of 2026-10-19 counted 1 and 49215. A style cannot run code; the script rule is the boundary.
# Starlight and Expressive Code write the style attributes, and a hash cannot cover a style attribute.
# img-src data: Starlight, Expressive Code, and Pagefind draw their icons as data: images in CSS.
# A data: image is bytes in the style sheet; it sends no request (ruling 12 of the plan 11b lane).
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval' {{SCRIPT_HASHES}}; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()

# The OpenAPI document is public data with no secret (plan 11g). A local tool
# in a browser on another origin loads it; no credential is sent or allowed.
# Rule form: Workers static assets docs, headers page, read 2026-10-19.
/docs/reference/openapi.json
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *

# The Atom feed (plan 11b Task 7). wrangler picks the type by the extension
# and sends application/xml for .xml (wrangler dev, 2026-10-20). RFC 4287
# section 7 registers application/atom+xml, so a feed reader knows the format.
/feed.xml
  Content-Type: application/atom+xml; charset=utf-8
